## API reference

### Select

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `default_value:` / `value:` | `String`, `Array` | - | The selection (an array when `multiple`). |
| `multiple:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Several values; submitted as `name[]`. |
| `size:` / `variant:` | `:sm`/`:md`/`:lg` / `:outline`/`:soft` | `:md` / `:outline` | Shared by the parts. |
| `align_item_with_trigger:` | `Boolean` | `true` | Open over the trigger with the selected item on it. Turn off with a start slot. |
| `items:` | `Hash`, `Array` | `{}` | Value → label, so the trigger shows labels before the list is read. |
| `name:`, `required:`, `disabled:`, `read_only:` | | | Form behaviour. |

Events: `ui--select:change` (`{ value }`) and `ui--select:open-change` (`{ open }`).

### SelectTrigger

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `clearable:` | `Boolean` | `false` | A ✕ once there's a value (Delete / Backspace clear too). |
| `start_slot:` / `end_slot:` | `Symbol`, `String`, `Proc` | - | Adornments; `start_slot: :selected` mirrors the selected item's `data: { icon: "start" }` element. |
| `invalid:` | `Boolean` | - | Error state (or `aria_invalid:`; a Field sets it). |

### SelectValue

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `placeholder:` | `String` | - | Shown when empty. |
| `summary:` | `String` | "%{count} selected" | For several values (translated). |

### SelectContent, SelectItem, SelectGroup, SelectGroupLabel, SelectSeparator

`SelectContent(side: :bottom | :top, side_offset: 6)`; `SelectItem(value:, label:, disabled:)` - `label:` is what the
trigger shows and typeahead matches (the item's text by default).

## Accessibility

- The trigger is a `role="combobox"` for a `listbox` of `option`s; focus stays on the trigger and the highlight is
  `aria-activedescendant`.
- Space / Enter / ↓ open it, ↑/↓ move, Enter selects, Escape closes, typing jumps to a matching option.
- The ✕ is decorative (`aria-hidden`); Delete / Backspace clear from the keyboard.
